{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5814565c-cdf1-8e98-b5fa-9b4d84747c23",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T12:20:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Deirdre Flynn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:17:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:17:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. Yes, I am calling about a crosswalk. The paint is so faded now, you almost cannot see it, and the cars they do not stop. Every day I wait and wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Which crosswalk is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:18:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Someone told me to have my address handy, so I have it here. It is 260 Harrison Avenue, on the Fort Adams side. The crosswalk is right in front, more or less."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:18:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 260 Harrison Avenue. And when you say the cars don't stop, are they speeding, or do they just not see the lines?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:18:31-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do not see, I think. Without the white lines it is like nothing is there. Yesterday a car passed me so close, and I was already in the street. I am a little tired of this, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. That's frustrating to deal with when you're just trying to cross. Do you have any pictures of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:18:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I have photos. I took some last week and one this morning. I can send them if you tell me where."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:19:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'll put a note on the request that photos are available, and somebody from the office will get in touch about how to send them. Is this the best number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:19:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is this one. Four oh one, five five five, zero one eight zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:19:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, zero one eight zero. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:19:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deirdre Flynn. Like it sounds, Deirdre, D-E-I-R-D-R-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:19:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, thank you Deirdre."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:19:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask, how long does it take usually, to fix something like this? Days? Weeks? Because I already waited a long time, the paint it was fading since the fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:19:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly it varies. Line painting is usually a bigger scheduled job, and it's hard to do in the cold, so it can be a matter of weeks, sometimes longer in winter. I'll flag it as a safety concern so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:20:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Weeks. Okay. In winter, I understand, the paint does not like the cold. But please, somebody should look at it, before a person gets hit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:20:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I've noted that. Somebody will review it and reach out about the photos."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you for your help, Denise. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:20:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Deirdre. Bye now."
    }
  ],
